Description: Parses drug and gene databases from their downloaded files:
    the 'DrugBank' XML database <https://go.drugbank.com/>, the 'OnSIDES' and
    'TWOSIDES' adverse drug event databases, Human Phenotype Ontology ('HPO')
    gene-phenotype associations, the 'HGNC' gene nomenclature files and
    Health Canada's Drug Product Database ('DPD') data extract. The parsed
    tables are returned in an 'R' object called 'dvobject', which records the
    source release, licence and file hashes.
